WEBVTT

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.410
Morning, Ren-chon.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.360
Why are you standing here 
staring into space?

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.820
The plum trees are in bloom.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.950
Oh, so they are.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.820
It'll be spring soon.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.570
Okay, you need to get 
ready to go to school.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.560
Natsumi's brother's graduation is today.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.230
See you at school.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.280
Okay.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.090
See ya.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.550
Let's go, Nii-chan.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.300
See you later.

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:00.230
A graduation ceremony...

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:07.540
Wow, Kazu-nee, you're dressed up today.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.660
Well, it's a graduation, after all.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.130
So it's finally Suguru's time...

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:16.520
Don't goof anything up today.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.750
Y-You'll jinx me if you 
say things like that...

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:32.150
<b>Congratulations
on Graduating</b>

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:32.140
It looks different today!

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:35.480
Yeah. It's not like our usual classroom.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:38.430
Well, shall we get started?

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:48.920
We will now begin the graduation ceremony.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:52.630
Would the graduate please enter?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.550
The presentation of your 
graduation certificate.

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.680
Koshigaya Suguru-dono,

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.020
Certificate of Graduation 
Koshigaya Suguru 
This document certifies that you have completed
all courses at Asahigaoka Branch School. 
 Asahigaoka Branch School

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:13.730
this document certifies that 
you have completed

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.760
all courses at Asahigaoka Branch School.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.600
Congratulations.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:43.930
Next, the remaining students will sing 
the school song for our graduate.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:48.150
Wait, I'm fine with singing, 
but who's playing the piano?

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.080
Dunno.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.440
Last time, I think it was...

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:00.000
<i>He's playing his own graduation song?</i>

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:28.110
<i>Among the mountains ablaze in green,</i>

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:39.770
<i>We can hear echoes of laughter</i>

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:52.090
<i>Our voices now ring out in song:</i>

00:03:52.750 --> 00:04:04.080
<i>Asahigaoka, our dear friend</i>

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:28.040
<i>Our school, bathed in gentle sunlight,</i>

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:39.940
<i>We will never forget you</i>

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:52.190
<i>Even after we fledge to the vast skies</i>

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.720
The ceremony's over.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.620
Let's go home.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:05:04.180
<i>Asahigaoka, our dear friend</i>

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:57.650
You know, we called it a graduation 
ceremony, but I didn't get emotional at all.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:02.600
Well, Onii-chan's not moving away or 
anything, so nothing will change.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.300
It's kind of weird, though,

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.660
to think he won't be coming 
to our school anymore.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.630
Still...

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.820
We should thank him.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.950
Thank you for everything!

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:30.190
Thank you for all you've 
done for us, Onii-san.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.880
Good job.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.460
Yeah... I guess it does feel kinda weird.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.800
Well, let's go home.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.370
See you later.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:42.490
Okay.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:43.980
See you.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:13.510
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.460
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.460
<b>The Cherry Blossoms Bloomed Again</b>

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.920
Shiori-chan.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.380
Renge-chan!

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.860
Were you going somewhere?

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.890
Yeah. I was taking a walk.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.010
I'm going home to eat now, 
so let's play after that.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.070
Okay. See you later, then.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.770
See you later!

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:52.180
Oh, so Glasses-kun had 
his graduation today?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.080
Yeah.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.670
Konomi-senpai!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:55.230
There she is.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.140
Sorry!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.200
Did I keep you waiting?

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.200
Don't worry about it.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.240
Well, ready to head to my place?

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:16.210
Senpai, thank you for inviting me 
over again when you're so busy.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:19.350
Actually, I've been pretty bored 
since the school term ended.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.350
Uh...

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.120
Something wrong?

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:26.450
Your graduation was just the other day,

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.380
but it feels like it was ages ago.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:32.580
Akane-chan gave me this 
as a graduation gift.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.580
U-Um...

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.300
She made it herself.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.660
What's this stick?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:42.360
Hey! It's a flute!

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.290
A flute?

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.650
I'm sorry it didn't turn out well...

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.170
No, I like it a lot.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.230
Really? Thank you!

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.390
Oh, I know!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.350
Look...

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.560
The store's closed today.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:01.490
But we wanted to buy some snacks for 
Glasses-kun to congratulate him on graduating.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:03.700
You couldn't get him something nicer?

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.300
Should you be saying that?

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.270
And, Hikage, don't you have school?

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.930
Our closing ceremony was a few 
days ago, so I came home.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:11.000
Huh...

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.970
That's fine and all, but...

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:16.080
When are you going to introduce us?

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.780
Wait, didn't I do that earlier?

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:19.950
No, you didn't.

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:23.350
This is Akane-chan from my club.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.260
She's your age, Hikage-chan.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.160
H-Hello.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.370
Nice to meet you.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.560
And you, as well.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.390
Akane-chan, she's your age. 
You don't have to be polite.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:34.780
Oh, okay.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:37.270
So you two go to the same high school?

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:38.000
Yeah.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.380
Oh, well, I go to high school in Tokyo.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.710
Tokyo?! That's amazing!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.890
Sh-She latched on!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:46.980
Yeah, Tokyo.

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:50.560
Wow... What's Tokyo like?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.720
Well, it's awesome, obviously!

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.340
So it really is amazing?

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.780
Uh, why don't we talk about it inside?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.160
I just told you, we're closed today!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.520
Well, if you just raise 
the shutter, it opens!

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:04.040
Hey! This isn't a tea house!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.360
Come on, this way.

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:06.720
Oh, sure.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.800
Sheesh... You'd better 
at least buy something.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.570
Huh, those two hit it off 
better than I expected.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.390
Ren-chon, let's play.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:29.760
I already made plans to 
play with Shiori-chan.

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:30.520
Really?

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:32.730
Hey, we can all play together!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:35.000
Shiori-chan's the police 
officer's daughter, right?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Yeah.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.850
Should we head to the police box, then?

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:38.670
Sure.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.980
Let's go!

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.430
Shiori-chan, I'm here to play.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.660
Coming!

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:52.060
There are a bunch of you!

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:53.550
I brought my friends.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.660
Heya.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:59.010
Shiori, you can go play, 
but don't be out too late.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:10:59.660
'Kay!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.020
Wow, her belly's so big!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.030
That's my baby sister.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:08.180
That's so cool! 
You're gonna be a big sister!

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:11.160
The police officer man isn't here?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.130
Daddy's outside.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.560
Wandering around outside 
is part of his job.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.270
It's calling "patrolling," Shiori.

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.460
You in there, Candy Store?

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:34.420
What do you want? I'm off today.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.690
You're open, though.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.250
<i>Someone</i> opened it on me.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.060
So, you need something?

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.760
We need some cardboard.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.210
Cardboard? Well, sure, I can spare some.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.680
Hey, Nacchan. You're all here, too?

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:49.620
Wow, that's an unusual combination.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.800
Here to buy something?

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:54.490
No, we wanted to borrow cardboard 
to play with outside.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.950
Oh... Maybe we'll tag along with you, then.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.310
That okay with you two?

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.320
What's up? We're going somewhere?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.900
That's fine with me.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.150
You should come, too, Kaede-chan.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.930
I told you, today's my day off.

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:10.740
I know! So you can close up the store!

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:19.840
Hey, Nattsun...

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.120
What are we doing with this cardboard?

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.440
Well, if we have hills and cardboard...

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.700
What else could it be?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.380
Here I go. Watch me!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.500
Wow!

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.660
Shiori-chan, race with me!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.540
Okay!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:47.460
Whoa, wait a second.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:50.410
It's too dangerous for kids. 
Slide with the older girls.

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.030
Then play with us, Candy Store!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:55.310
Uh... Sure, I guess...

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:59.110
Shiori-chan, right? Want to slide with—

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:02.020
Onee-chan, let's slide together.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:03.670
Okay, sure.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:05.390
Yay!

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.530
Komari-chan, want to slide with me?

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:10.070
Sure.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.380
What're you smiling about?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.700
Are you plotting something?

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:39.340
Hey! I don't "plot" things.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:39.970
Huh?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.650
I just... I don't know...

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.940
I think about how you went off to Tokyo,

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.940
Renge-chan started first grade,

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:52.640
and it's been a year since 
I met Akane-chan...

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:57.590
It feels like it's been so long, 
but also no time at all.

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:00.670
What's that mean?

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.870
Aren't you kinda young to get 
all sentimental like that?

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:07.370
Actually, I've been feeling like 
that more than you'd think.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.170
Whew, I'm exhausted.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.890
We played for a pretty long time.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.900
Shiori-chan, we'll walk you home.

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.750
Okay. Thanks.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:30.730
Okay, we'll keep going with Shiori-chan.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:31.800
Got it.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.110
See you later.

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:37.550
Mommy, I'm home.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:42.990
Mommy?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.740
Your mom's not home?

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.780
I heard a noise from the 
room in the back...

00:14:55.200 --> 00:15:04.960
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:04.720
Mommy, where are you?

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:06.100
Mommy!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.050
Mommy, are you okay?

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.150
Shiori... and Renge-chan...

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:13.180
What's wrong?

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.380
You look pale.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.710
I... I think the baby's coming...

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.930
The baby?!

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:21.070
A-A-Are you okay?!

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:24.080
The police officer man isn't back yet?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:26.820
Th-The hospital! We gotta call a taxi!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:31.520
The number is written on the board 
on the wall in the police box.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.280
I'd appreciate it if you could call them.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.750
Natsumi, go!

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:36.940
G-Got it!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:49.610
We'll watch Shiori-chan until 
your husband comes home.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.200
I'm sorry to put you all through this.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:54.810
Mommy...

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.390
I'm sorry, Shiori.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.450
Be a good girl for a little while, okay?

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:12.140
Ren-chon.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.570
It's almost time for school.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:15.920
What're you looking at?

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:18.180
The cherry blossoms.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.100
Oh, they sure are pretty.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:26.860
Actually, Nee-nee, I'm surprised 
you're awake for once.

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:30.320
Well, you're in second grade now.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.450
I need to keep my act together, too.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:39.430
Come on, Ren-chon. Let's have 
breakfast and head to school.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.540
'Kay.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.570
Oh, Nii-chan, you're heading out already?

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.320
It's so early.

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:51.960
I guess you do have to take 
the train to school now.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.220
I'm still not used to seeing 
you in that uniform.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.790
I'm going now.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:00.280
Okay. Be careful.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:25.840
Ren-chon?

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:30.800
It's spring again.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.420
It sure is.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.040
Heya.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.490
Morning, Renge.

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.460
Good morning, Sensei.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:40.970
Oh, you're all together, I see.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.140
No, wait.

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.510
This isn't all of us yet.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:47.480
I know.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.370
Let's all go and meet her.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.780
Coming!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.590
Oh, good morning, all of you.

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:01.330
Good morning.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:02.550
Shiori-chan—

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.710
It's the baby!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.050
It is! She's so cute!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:13.790
Hi there, girls.

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:17.010
Thank you for all you did that 
night. You were a big help.

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.120
Not at all.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:20.380
We really didn't do anything that special.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:21.980
What's her name?

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:23.510
It's Kasumi.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.880
Oh, that's a nice name.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:27.640
She's so tiny.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.900
You know, it's still a little early...

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.770
but when Kasumi is old 
enough to go to school,

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.210
I hope you'll look out for her, Renge-chan.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.790
School...

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.850
That's right. When she 
starts elementary school,

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:46.020
you'll be in middle school, Ren-chon.

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:49.000
You two will be going to school together.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:50.390
Then...

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:54.340
When you're older, 
we'll go to school together.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.520
I promise.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:10.970
We made a promise!

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.170
Renge-chan!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.660
Morning!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.220
Meowning.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:18.030
Meowning!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:22.480
Okay, we're all together now. 
Ready to head to the bus stop?

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:30.050
Shiori-chan, I'll teach you all 
the secrets to dodgeball today.

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:30.460
Okay!

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:33.160
You'll even be able to hold 
your own against Koma-chan.

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:36.860
Even I wouldn't lose to 
someone that much younger.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:37.510
Oh...

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.440
Come to think of it, 
I forgot to do my homework.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:43.750
I'm impressed you can say that 
right in front of your teacher.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:47.400
W-Well, I guess she might just be honest...

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:22.380
Hotarun! Shiori-chan!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.840
Hurry before the bus gets here!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.120
We still have time.

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:29.210
You know when the bus comes.

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.010
This is the same route we take every day,

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:33.310
but you always have so much 
fun with it, Ren-chon.

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:39.020
It's not the same route every day.

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.670
When it's rainy or cloudy,

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:45.320
it's a little bit different. 
That's what's fun.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:57.470
It's different today, too! 
It's a sunny day!

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:25.460
Grade 8 Class 1

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:25.460
<b>+Grade 1
+Grade 6
